    "title": "Dynamics 365 Business Central and customer engagement apps: operational data to Microsoft Fabric analytics",
    "subtitle": "Customer engagement apps reach OneLake through Dataverse Link to Fabric (shortcuts); Business Central is replicated through an open mirrored database fed by an extract function; both land in one Fabric lakehouse for Power BI and a data agent",
